{"3144430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Exovia", "steam_appid": 3144430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zero-G Logistics</strong>: Who needs conveyor belts? Use ZERO GRAVITY PHYSICS to manage your factory!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From Chaos to Order:</strong> Experiment with layouts and optimise filters to maximise output (and prevent congestion)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Giant Newtonian Machines</strong>: Create floating factories that seamlessly work together </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally-generated Asteroids</strong>: Every map is unique</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shareable seeds:</strong> Give your asteroid code to your friends </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40 Different Elements</strong>: Find, mine, transform, and process them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgradable Skills:</strong> Level up your astronaut to match your play style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customisation:</strong> Add a personal touch to your factory and astronaut</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>17 Music Tracks:</strong> A soundscape full of relaxing space vibes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feel the Zen:</strong> No time pressure, no dangers, just the vast expanse of space</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> Mission control is spoken by our <strong>human</strong> voice actress Sarah Nightingale<strong> </strong><br> <br><strong>About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave gravity behind in Exovia, a <strong>physics-driven automation game</strong> where every resource obeys the laws of Newtonian physics. Solve deeply satisfying engineering challenges, build massive space factories, and find your flow in the quiet expanse of the void. You have been sent alone on a mission to build a Warpgate for the rest of humanity — a gateway to a future deep within the vastness of space.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/efe6aaa0d0b547c3c56f04a7426ece61.avif?t=1787244138\" width=792 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/75643d19b19dac2cdde1b21dd1595571.poster.avif?t=1787244138\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/75643d19b19dac2cdde1b21dd1595571.webm?t=1787244138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/75643d19b19dac2cdde1b21dd1595571.mp4?t=1787244138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zero-G mining isn't just point-and-click! Shatter space rock with your <strong>mining laser</strong> and watch as valuable materials scatter in every direction, bouncing off walls and each other. Plan your storage, maneuver skillfully and use your <strong>vacuum</strong> to wrangle <strong>floating resources</strong>. Explore diverse asteroid biomes, discover rare materials, and upgrade your tools to tackle tougher challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/6ab097009ccb83bf9050159476b937ee.avif?t=1787244138\" width=792 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/257a52cd47bdcb75d5bab807fc8a7049.poster.avif?t=1787244138\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/257a52cd47bdcb75d5bab807fc8a7049.webm?t=1787244138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/257a52cd47bdcb75d5bab807fc8a7049.mp4?t=1787244138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No conveyor belts</strong>, just pure physics! Design and build free-floating logistics systems to transport your resources across the asteroid. Use kinetic force to move, split, merge, and sort streams of floating ores exactly where they need to go. It’s a completely fresh approach to automation that requires you to <strong>think outside the box</strong>—and outside of gravity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/55b6fa57d789cedea5b04629165443e2.avif?t=1787244138\" width=792 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/9f5c6c9732757545b404b4c101f1b23c.poster.avif?t=1787244138\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/9f5c6c9732757545b404b4c101f1b23c.webm?t=1787244138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/9f5c6c9732757545b404b4c101f1b23c.mp4?t=1787244138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scale up</strong> from a single refiner to a massive, interconnected production chain. Expand, tweak, and optimize your designs to meet ever-increasing output demands. Every solution you engineer paves the way for a new, exciting problem to solve. How efficient can you make your <strong>zero-G assembly line</strong>?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/e0135396e6727a1c45c142b4497b6d26.avif?t=1787244138\" width=792 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/542dcbc4cebbd7458cf4166f139b5dbb.poster.avif?t=1787244138\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/542dcbc4cebbd7458cf4166f139b5dbb.webm?t=1787244138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/542dcbc4cebbd7458cf4166f139b5dbb.mp4?t=1787244138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your operation scales, so does the “physical madness”! Unguided ores drift away, kinetic collisions cause <strong>logistical traffic jams</strong>, and unexpected physics mishaps will test your designs. Tweak your layouts, adjust your angles, and find creative physical solutions to master the mess. There is nothing quite as deeply satisfying as watching a chaotic cloud of space debris suddenly click into a beautifully synchronized, smoothly running factory ballet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/e7213c8ef6b78d4ebf464cfa0b5bb60c.avif?t=1787244138\" width=792 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/1181a4b22957ab5e0af86f0ff6b8a385.poster.avif?t=1787244138\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/1181a4b22957ab5e0af86f0ff6b8a385.webm?t=1787244138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/1181a4b22957ab5e0af86f0ff6b8a385.mp4?t=1787244138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No ticking clocks, no hostile aliens, and no pressure. It’s just you, floating in the quiet expanse of space, solving engineering problems <strong>at your own pace</strong>. Whether you want to dive deep, optimize your production lines or simply relax and mine rare minerals while your machines do the heavy lifting, Exovia is your mini-vacation in space. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > *This page text was translated with the assistance of AI.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> Mission control is spoken by our <strong>human</strong> voice actress Sarah Nightingale<strong> </strong><br> <br><strong>About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave gravity behind in Exovia, a <strong>physics-driven automation game</strong> where every resource obeys the laws of Newtonian physics. Solve deeply satisfying engineering challenges, build massive space factories, and find your flow in the quiet expanse of the void. You have been sent alone on a mission to build a Warpgate for the rest of humanity — a gateway to a future deep within the vastness of space.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/efe6aaa0d0b547c3c56f04a7426ece61.avif?t=1787244138\" width=792 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/75643d