 to move, split, merge, and sort streams of floating ores exactly where they need to go. It’s a completely fresh approach to automation that requires you to <strong>think outside the box</strong>—and outside of gravity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/55b6fa57d789cedea5b04629165443e2.avif?t=1787244138\" width=792 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/9f5c6c9732757545b404b4c101f1b23c.poster.avif?t=1787244138\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/9f5c6c9732757545b404b4c101f1b23c.webm?t=1787244138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/9f5c6c9732757545b404b4c101f1b23c.mp4?t=1787244138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scale up</strong> from a single refiner to a massive, interconnected production chain. Expand, tweak, and optimize your designs to meet ever-increasing output demands. Every solution you engineer paves the way for a new, exciting problem to solve. How efficient can you make your <strong>zero-G assembly line</strong>?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/e0135396e6727a1c45c142b4497b6d26.avif?t=1787244138\" width=792 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/542dcbc4cebbd7458cf4166f139b5dbb.poster.avif?t=1787244138\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/542dcbc4cebbd7458cf4166f139b5dbb.webm?t=1787244138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/542dcbc4cebbd7458cf4166f139b5dbb.mp4?t=1787244138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your operation scales, so does the “physical madness”! Unguided ores drift away, kinetic collisions cause <strong>logistical traffic jams</strong>, and unexpected physics mishaps will test your designs. Tweak your layouts, adjust your angles, and find creative physical solutions to master the mess. There is nothing quite as deeply satisfying as watching a chaotic cloud of space debris suddenly click into a beautifully synchronized, smoothly running factory ballet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/e7213c8ef6b78d4ebf464cfa0b5bb60c.avif?t=1787244138\" width=792 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/1181a4b22957ab5e0af86f0ff6b8a385.poster.avif?t=1787244138\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/1181a4b22957ab5e0af86f0ff6b8a385.webm?t=1787244138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/1181a4b22957ab5e0af86f0ff6b8a385.mp4?t=1787244138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No ticking clocks, no hostile aliens, and no pressure. It’s just you, floating in the quiet expanse of space, solving engineering problems <strong>at your own pace</strong>. Whether you want to dive deep, optimize your production lines or simply relax and mine rare minerals while your machines do the heavy lifting, Exovia is your mini-vacation in space. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > *This page text was translated with the assistance of AI.</p>", "short_description": "Exovia is a physics-based mining and automation sandbox in space. Survey asteroids, engineer zero-G logistics without conveyor belts, and design complex Newtonian factories. Turn floating chaos into perfect order and experience true inner peace as you solve one satisfying problem and then the next.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/d44de100246a3329bbc232655f367acea70371cd/header.jpg?t=1787244138", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/b8d97829e28562e9bc5c0ebfeb4c302e9e597d91/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787244138", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/b8d97829e28562e9bc5c0ebfeb4c302e9e597d91/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787244138", "website": "https://www.byterockers.games/exovia", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows® 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i7-7700 (or quad-core equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA® GTX™ 1060 / 6GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 16 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows® 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i5-9900 (or eight-cor